  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">L4-50 SSC-Forestry entrepen&#xf6;rst&#xf6;d</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">L4-50 SSC-Forestry entrepreneurialsupport</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By producing, in co-operation with small scale farmers, high quality wood products in a sustainable,transparent, safe and fair way (third  party certified by FSC and FLOCert) will they access to a new, and for competitors practically closed, high-paying market segment for tropical hardwood. Agreement partner is Svensk SkogsCertifiering AB (SSC Forestry), org reg no 556102-8621, Sweden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom att producera, i samarbete med sm&#xe5;skaliga b&#xf6;nder, h&#xf6;gkvalitativa tr&#xe4;varor i ett h&#xe5;llbart, &#xf6;ppet, tryggt och r&#xe4;ttvist s&#xe4;tt (tredje part certifierade av FSC och FLOCert) kommer de att f&#xe5;   tillg&#xe5;ng till en ny, och f&#xf6;r konkurrenter i praktiken st&#xe4;ngd, h&#xf6;g-betala marknadssegment f&#xf6;r tropiskt tr&#xe4;. Avtalspart &#xe4;r Svensk SkogsCertifiering AB (SSC Forestry), org.nr 556102-8621, Sverige.</narrative>
  </description>
